               <node>
                  <name>Focal-to-bilateral-tonic-clonic-focal-onset-epileptic-seizure</name>
                  <description>A seizure type with focal onset, with awareness or impaired awareness, either motor or non-motor, progressing to bilateral tonic clonic activity. The prior term was seizure with partial onset with secondary generalization.</description>
